<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n57858" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλῆμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, 
			Aeol.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλᾶμμα</span></b>  (q.v.), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>twig</i> or <i>branch</i>, esp.
				<i>vinetwig</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ec.</u>
				1031
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				4.50
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				6.3.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				2.5.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>CP</u>
				3.14.6
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμπέλου κ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					353a
				</span></i>
			: generally, <i>cutting, slip</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ βλαστὸς τοῦ κ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Oec.</u>
					19.8
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				550b8
			</span></i>: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνατετμήκασί τινες τὰ κ.
				τὰ τοῦ δήμου</span>
			D.ap.Aeschin.<i><span class="en">
				3.166
			</span></i>; of the navel string, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεῖσμα καὶ κ. τῷ γεννωμένῳ καρπῷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Democr.
					148
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>vine-switch, cane</i>, carried by Roman centurions,
				Lat.<i>vitis</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Galb.</u>
				26
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πιτυοῦσσα</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.165
			</span></i>; 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολύγονον</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				27.113
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπόδημα</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλείματα</span>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
